<title>THAILAND: Thai Oct C/A deficit narrows to 30.2 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai Oct C/A deficit narrows to 30.2 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's October current account deficit narrowed to a preliminary 30.2 billion baht from a revised 30.5 billion baht deficit in September, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    C/A DEFICIT	   Oct 96	Sept 96	Oct 95</p>
<p>				 30.2	   30.5	 34.8</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
</text>
